  "content": "\u003cdiv class=\"field field-name-field-government\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"taxonomy-term taxonomy-term--type-government taxonomy-term--view-mode-strapline ds-1col clearfix\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n      \u003cem class=\"archive-indicator\"\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n    \n      \u003ctime class=\"meta meta__date\" datetime=\"\"\u003e\u003ctime datetime=\"2024-07-25T04:23:30Z\"\u003e25 July 2024\u003c/time\u003e\n\u003c/time\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n  \u003ch1 class=\"article__title\"\u003e\n  Transport Minister thanks outgoing CAA Chair\n\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n    \n            \u003cul class=\"meta--ministers\"\u003e\n            \u003cli\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"teaser--small minister taxonomy-term taxonomy-term--type-ministers taxonomy-term--view-mode-teaser-small ds-1col clearfix\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n  \u003ca href=\"/minister/hon-simeon-brown\" class=\"field-group-link minister__link\" hreflang=\"en\"\u003e    \n      \u003cdiv class=\"field minister__portrait\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\n  \n  \n            \u003cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field--item\"\u003e  \u003cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail/public/2023-12/Brown.jpg?itok=eEbu_QYS\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" alt=\"Simeon Brown portrait\" class=\"img-responsive\"/\u003e\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      \n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      \n  \n\n    \n      \u003cdiv class=\"field minister__title\"\u003e  Hon Simeon Brown\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\u003c/a\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003c/li\u003e\n      \n      \u003c/ul\u003e\n  \n\n    \n      \u003cem class=\"tag tag--portfolio\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"tag taxonomy-term taxonomy-term--type-portfolios taxonomy-term--view-mode-teaser-small ds-1col clearfix\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n  \n    \u003ca href=\"/portfolio/nationalactnew-zealand-first-coalition-government-2023-2026/transport\" hreflang=\"en\"\u003eTransport\u003c/a\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n            \u003cdiv class=\"prose field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field--item\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTransport Minister Simeon Brown has thanked outgoing Chair of the Civil Aviation Authority, Janice Fredric, for her service to the board.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e“I have received Ms Fredric’s resignation from the role of Chair of the Civil Aviation Authority,” Mr Brown says.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e“On behalf of the Government, I want to thank Ms Fredric for her service in the important role of Chair of the Civil Aviation Authority.”\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMs Fredric has served as Chair of the Civil Aviation Authority since December 2019.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      ",
  "content_text": "Transport Minister Simeon Brown has thanked outgoing Chair of the Civil Aviation Authority, Janice Fredric, for her service to the board. “I have received Ms Fredric’s resignation from the role of Chair of the Civil Aviation Authority,” Mr Brown says. “On behalf of the Government, I want to thank Ms Fredric for her service in the important role of Chair of the Civil Aviation Authority.” Ms Fredric has served as Chair of the Civil Aviation Authority since December 2019.",
